title: "GeoDensityR: Generate Density Rasters from Polygon and Census Data"
version: 0.2.2
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24304734
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sahalpaladan/GeoDensityR"
url: "https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=GeoDensityR"
abstract: "Creates continuous density raster surfaces by joining vector spatial layers with tabular data, normalizing values by ellipsoidal polygon area. Reconciles boundary-constrained census or survey counts with uniform raster grids."
keywords:
  - R
  - terra
  - rasterization
  - census data
  - population density
